OL,3,GNEWSAWomen 'living in fear' over MoD
OL,4,Aasylum housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of female villagers say "life
OL,7,Fas we know it will be destroyed" if
OL,8,Fplans to house asylum seekers at a
OL,9,Fnearby former Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,10,Fsite succeed.
OL,12,FEarlier this year, the Home Office
OL,13,Fannounced plans to house 1,256 men at
OL,14,FMoD Bicester, saying the proposal would
OL,15,Fbring the system "back under control".
OL,17,FBut the plans have proved contentious
OL,18,Flocally, including in nearby Piddington
OL,19,Fwhere a symbolic independence
OL,20,Freferendum in opposition to the
OL,21,Fproposals is being held next week.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
